. * Phase 6b: svy with several stages, replicates (jackknife, BRR, bootstrap, SDR), estat effects and more models
. clear

. estimates clear

. ereturn clear

. set seed 600

. set obs 200
number of observations (_N) was 0, now 200

. gen estrato = ceil(_n/50)

. gen upa = ceil(_n/10)

. gen peso = 50 + mod(_n, 7)*10

. gen sexo = mod(_n, 2)

. label define sexol 0 "masc" 1 "fem"

. label values sexo sexol

. gen idade = 18 + floor(runiform()*60)

. gen ativo = runiform() < invlogit(-1 + .02*idade - .5*sexo)

. gen imc = 22 + .05*idade + 2*sexo + round(runiform()*4, .01)

. mean imc

Mean estimation                   Number of obs   =        200

--------------------------------------------------------------
             |       Mean   Std. Err.     [95% Conf. Interval]
-------------+------------------------------------------------
         imc |     27.285   .1244698      27.03955    27.53045
--------------------------------------------------------------

. gen nivel = 1 + (imc > 26) + (imc > 28)

. gen cont = floor(idade/10)

. gen upa2 = mod(_n, 2)

. gen npop = 20

. gen n2 = 10

. svyset upa [pweight=peso], strata(estrato)

      pweight: peso
          VCE: linearized
  Single unit: missing
     Strata 1: estrato
         SU 1: upa
        FPC 1: <zero>

